// Question bank for Quotes, one of the daily gauntlets. Imported ONLY by the
// server page (app/quotes/page.js), which resolves the picked day's twenty-five
// questions and hands the client just that day, so the rest of the bank never
// reaches a browser.
//
//   id       'd<day>q<slot>' - authored day and play order (slot 1..25)
